00:02:48.634 --> 00:02:50.267
♪ Monday, Tuesday,
Wednesday, Thursday ♪

00:02:50.267 --> 00:02:51.534
♪ Friday, Saturday, Sunday ♪

00:02:51.534 --> 00:02:53.033
For him. For him.

00:02:53.033 --> 00:02:55.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:55.968 --> 00:02:57.734
