the judge told him to,

00:02:59.434 --> 00:03:02.868
"Please answer yes or no."

00:03:02.868 --> 00:03:04.934
And Trump went, "Yes or no."

00:03:04.934 --> 00:03:06.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.634 --> 00:03:09.033
