The judge was annoyed.

00:03:09.033 --> 00:03:10.968
And the lawyers were
trying to keep peace.

00:03:10.968 --> 00:03:14.601
The courtroom basically turned
into everyone's Thanksgiving.

00:03:14.601 --> 00:03:17.267
